flowchart LR
 Observe[Observe video quality] --> Good{Usable region?}
 Good -- No --> Adapt[Switch ROI or defer]
 Adapt --> Good
 Good -- Yes --> Trigger[Operator upload or validated camera excitation]
 Trigger --> Measure[Execute OpenCV measurement]
 Measure --> Assess{Evidence sufficient?}
 Assess -- No --> Retry[Change window, method or ROIs]
 Retry --> Limit{Retry budget remains?}
 Limit -- Yes --> Measure
 Limit -- No --> Insufficient[Insufficient evidence]
 Assess -- Yes --> Baseline{Healthy baseline and temperature?}
 Baseline -- No --> Insufficient
 Baseline -- Yes --> Compare[Prediction interval comparison]
 Compare --> Normal[No change detected]
 Compare --> Watch[Watch and raised sampling request]
 Compare --> Alert[Confirmed drop requests approval]
 Alert --> Human{Human review}
 Human -- Approve --> Act[Delivery outbox]
 Human -- Reject --> Reject[Reason retained, no delivery]
